# Simulation output in dev/ (rule set 2026-11-19). Tracked: scripts, the
# write-up (.qmd and rendered pdf), the slim/summary results it reads (and
# their dated copies), csv summaries and run logs. Never tracked: per-cell
# or per-replication files, smoke-test output, render logs. Full-size
# results that the write-up does not read get a folder entry above.
dev/**/*cells*/
dev/**/*smoke*.rds
dev/**/render*.log
tests/testthat/_problems/
